chapter.v:
	Bondservants, be 

	 obedient to those who are your masters according to the flesh, with fear and trembling, in sincerity of heart, as to Christ;
 [Col. 3:5 h Eph.]

	and having 

	 shod your feet with the preparation of the gospel of peace;
 [1 Kin. 13:17;]

	And take 

	 the helmet of salvation, and the sword of the Spirit, which is the word of God;
 [Dan. 7:13;]
